From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: steamac <steamac@local>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:16:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] kk: advertise VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod by default

It was behind MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=image_view_min_lod ("may not provide
full correctness or may negatively impact performance"). The lowering
(kk_nir_lower_image_view_min_lod, as in hk) costs a 16-bit descriptor
load and a max per sample when an application enables minLod, and
fetches below the minimum LOD read zero. vkd3d-proton uses it for
ResourceMinLODClamp; without it, it rebases views to the clamped level
(wrong sizes, levels and residency): its test_view_min_lod passes
706/706 with the extension and fails 10 without. Sparse samples through
a view with a minimum LOD over unbound finer levels read the coarser
level and report it resident.
---
 docs/drivers/kosmickrisp.rst                | 1 -
 docs/features.txt                           | 2 +-
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c           | 1 -
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h           | 2 --
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 2 +-
 5 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/drivers/kosmickrisp.rst b/docs/drivers/kosmickrisp.rst
index 52f0f9b..99e86a1 100644
--- a/docs/drivers/kosmickrisp.rst
+++ b/docs/drivers/kosmickrisp.rst
@@ -81,7 +81,6 @@ KosmicKrisp specific environment variables:
 - ``MESA_KK_DISABLE_WORKAROUNDS``: Provide ``all`` to disable all workarounds. Otherwise, provide a comma separated list to disable wanted workarounds e.g. ``1,3,4`` to disable workaround 1, 3 and 4.
 - ``MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL``: Enables advertising experimental features which may not provide full correctness or may negatively impact performance when enabled. Provide ``all`` to advertise all listed features.
   - ``custom_border`` to advertise ``VK_EXT_custom_border_color`` and ``VK_EXT_border_color_swizzle``.
-  - ``image_view_min_lod`` to advertise ``VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod``.
   - ``m5_optimize_e5r9g9b9`` to use allowGPUOptimizedContents on M5 with this format, which causes some CTS tests for vkCmdCopyImage() to fail
 
 Metal workarounds
diff --git a/docs/features.txt b/docs/features.txt
index 3acac37..215a88d 100644
--- a/docs/features.txt
+++ b/docs/features.txt
@@ -661,7 +661,7 @@ Khronos extensions that are not part of any Vulkan version:
   VK_EXT_image_compression_control_swapchain            DONE (radv, tu)
   VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier                      DONE (anv, hasvk, hk, lvp, nvk, panvk, pvr, radv, tu, v3dv, vn)
   VK_EXT_image_sliced_view_of_3d                        DONE (anv, hk, lvp, nvk, panvk, pvr, radv/gfx10+, vn)
-  VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod                             DONE (anv, hasvk, hk, nvk, panvk, radv, tu, vn)
+  VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod                             DONE (anv, hasvk, hk, kk, nvk, panvk, radv, tu, vn)
   VK_EXT_index_type_uint8                               DONE (anv, hasvk, hk, kk, nvk, lvp, panvk, pvr, radv/gfx8+, tu, v3dv, vn)
   VK_EXT_legacy_dithering                               DONE (anv, panvk, tu, vn)
   VK_EXT_legacy_vertex_attributes                       DONE (anv, lvp, nvk, radv, tu, vn)
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index 1805d66..763c750 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -21,7 +21,6 @@ enum kk_experimental kk_mesa_experimental_flags = 0;
 const struct debug_named_value experimental_flags[] = {
    {"all", UINT64_MAX},
    {"custom_border", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_CUSTOM_BORDER},
-   {"image_view_min_lod", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_IMAGE_VIEW_MIN_LOD},
    {"m5_optimize_e5b9g9r9", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_M5_OPTIMIZE_E5B9G9R9},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index f454804..9084a62 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -21,8 +21,6 @@ extern enum kk_debug kk_mesa_debug_flags;
 enum kk_experimental {
    /* Advertise custom border features */
    KK_EXPERIMENTAL_CUSTOM_BORDER = 1ull << 0,
-   /* Advertise image view min LOD feature */
-   KK_EXPERIMENTAL_IMAGE_VIEW_MIN_LOD = 1ull << 1,
    /* Using allowGPUOptimizedContents on M5 for this format causes
     * vkCmdCopyImage() tests in CTS to fail, but it is otherwise usable */
    KK_EXPERIMENTAL_M5_OPTIMIZE_E5B9G9R9 = 1ull << 2,
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index ec046aa..b5cb097 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -184,7 +184,7 @@ kk_get_device_extensions(const struct kk_instance *instance,
       .EXT_external_memory_host = true,
       .EXT_hdr_metadata = true,
       .EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d = true,
-      .EXT_image_view_min_lod = KK_EXPERIMENTAL(IMAGE_VIEW_MIN_LOD),
+      .EXT_image_view_min_lod = true,
       .EXT_load_store_op_none = true,
       .EXT_map_memory_placed = true,
       .EXT_memory_budget = true,
